}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}A(t)\\,dt & =A(t)(-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st})\\,{|}_{0}^{\\infty }-{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }(-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st}){A}^{′}(t)\\,dt.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $A(0)=0$ and $\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ we have $-\\frac{1}{s}A(t){e}^{-st}{|}_{0}^{\\infty }=0$ and\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}A(t)\\,dt=\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}{A}^{′}(t)\\,dt.\n$$\n\nFinally, using that ${A}^{′}(t)=f(t),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}{A}^{′}(t)\\,dt & =\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}f(t)\\,dt \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s}\\cdot F(s) \\\\  & =\\frac{F(s)}{s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534871 17592186045417 true] [17592186442022 1068 #edb/ref 17592186442012 13194139534871 17592186045417 true] [17592186442022 1069 "q-330846" 13194139534871 17592186045417 true] [17592186442022 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534871 17592186045417 true] [17592186442022 1071 "For the function\n\n$$\nG(s)=\\frac{1}{s(s-4)},\\,s>4\n$$\n\nfind the inverse Laplace transform of $G(s),$ given that\n$L\\{{e}^{at}\\}=\\frac{1}{s-a},\\text{ }s>a.$" 13194139534871 17592186045417 true] [17592186442022 1072 #uuid "a9ec2e0a-7b21-59e9-965b-b9f812cb11e6" 13194139534871 17592186045417 true] [17592186442022 1074 "Notice that we can write $G(s)$ as \n\n$$\nG(s)=\\frac{1}{s(s-4)}=\\frac{F(s)}{s},\n$$\n\nwhere $F(s)=\\frac{1}{s-4}.$\nAlso, we know that\n\n$$\nL\\{{e}^{at}\\}=\\frac{1}{s-a}.\n$$\n\nThus, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}\\{F(s)\\} & ={L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{1}{s-4}\\} \\\\  & ={e}^{4t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdditionally, we know that if $L\\{f(t)\\}=F(s)$, then\n\n$$\nL\\{{\\int }_{0}^{t}f(τ)\\,\\text{d}τ\\}=\\frac{F(s)}{s}.\n$$\n\nUsing the property above in reverse, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}\\{G(s)\\} & ={L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{F(s)}{s}\\} \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}f(τ)\\,\\text{d}τ \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{4τ}\\,\\text{d}τ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4τ}\\,{|}_{0}^{t} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}({e}^{4t}-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534871 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-04325bda-e16b-59f8-9964-8026cd70bcc7" 17592186441936 "answer-05e577cb-6cdd-5f4a-9bfb-6da332c7cc7a" 17592186441937 "answer-06fc54b3-e12f-563f-ad7c-4dcf67f6e141" 17592186441938 "answer-07d7257d-8558-5174-b584-bebeccdc3e51" 17592186441939 "answer-10a07a90-d683-57da-8fc8-5a970843054f" 17592186441940 "answer-193f22df-b786-5f14-a1f2-c1ec092974ab" 17592186441941 "answer-1cce92eb-4d82-5c1d-addd-ef44b4743b55" 17592186441942 "answer-20e282f4-88ec-52d6-8ea7-9a6576df4b1f" 17592186441943 "answer-2202e53c-8362-54c1-a712-585510d9289a" 17592186441944 "answer-244f06ac-0ae7-5008-8b27-bc7253233120" 17592186441945 "answer-27216b69-d2aa-588b-b25c-49b94f88c580" 17592186441946 "answer-27a1e96a-2d02-5798-a435-19834cb6e962" 17592186441947 "answer-2a30e7cc-fc7b-56c2-9720-f3d38dd588b0" 17592186441948 "answer-2e92e92d-075f-5e99-a320-d6d09182f195" 17592186441949 "answer-31bff94b-20f3-5f6b-a517-e5ef54908756" 17592186441950 "answer-33c2a665-68e3-5397-aad1-394033317b09" 17592186441951 "answer-344220eb-e137-5ef4-9290-8367a1f2b18c" 17592186441952 "answer-373e9c97-d5d1-54a7-a3e3-56e016bbff64" 17592186441953 "answer-397f965b-6bb7-559f-abdf-3ffb9c3f2410" 17592186441954 "answer-39c02819-40bd-5059-a783-65b80eec32c3" 17592186441955 "answer-3a067135-e5b7-55d1-925b-a9eb022c03a2" 17592186441956 "answer-3a91e5a1-a660-55f2-baab-40111b102a41" 17592186441957 "answer-3b1e4ee7-a4a8-50f8-92de-c0996cee8aa8" 17592186441958 "answer-3c3d659d-d6ec-5e9b-87ec-2f606fd5411d" 17592186441959 "answer-43529d94-eb1a-54f8-a97a-d90e5c2dedc7" 17592186441960 "answer-438c51eb-af54-5958-b35d-17a8fa5ebd0f" 17592186441961 "answer-46995870-fd5c-52bf-8d60-a3a53e6b049c" 17592186441962 "answer-4b585c91-a64d-5156-9b47-3ab3be96c10e" 17592186441963 "answer-52cb8d2c-e759-551f-9715-4601dae1cfca" 17592186441964 "answer-532e7f80